     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I recently installed RStan 2.9.0-3 on Windows 7, R version 3.2.3. When I tried to run the 8schools.stan model on the RStan Getting Started guide, I got the following compile error. Something I am doing wrong?</div><div><br></div><div>FYI - RStan is installed in a library on a network drive (my IT department forces us to do this), while Base R libraries are on the local C: drive. I have had success getting other libraries (like dplyr) working with this configuration.</div><div><br></div><div><span>fit</span> <span>&lt;-</span> stan(<span>file</span> <span>=</span> <span><span>&#39;</span>8schools.stan<span>&#39;</span></span>, <span>data</span> <span>=</span> <span>schools_dat</span>, <br>            <span>iter</span> <span>=</span> <span>1000</span>, <span>chains</span> <span>=</span> <span>4</span>)</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"margin:0px;border:currentColor;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt!important;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in compileCode(f, code, language = language, verbose = verbose) : <br>  Compilation ERROR, function(s)/method(s) not created! file2a143b62373d.cpp:8:39: fatal error: stan/model/model_header.hpp: No such file or directory<br>compilation terminated.<br>make: *** [file2a143b62373d.o] Error 1<br>Warning message:<br>running command &#39;make -f &quot;C:/PROGRA~1/R/R-32~1.3/etc/x64/Makeconf&quot; -f &quot;C:/PROGRA~1/R/R-32~1.3/share/make/<a href=\"http://winshlib.mk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://winshlib.mk&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792461634220000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Hoa_kfqNwa8go2scASvHf\">winshlib.mk</a>&quot; -f &quot;//&lt;my drive&gt;/.R/Makevars&quot; SHLIB_LDFLAGS=&#39;$(SHLIB_CXXLDFLAGS)&#39; SHLIB_LD=&#39;$(SHLIB_CXXLD)&#39; SHLIB=&quot;file2a143b62373d.dll&quot; WIN=64 TCLBIN=64 OBJECTS=&quot;file2a143b62373d.o&quot;&#39; had status 2 <br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In addition: </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Warning message:<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">running command &#39;C:/PROGRA~1/R/R-32~1.3/bin/x64/R CMD SHLIB file2a143b62373d.cpp 2&gt; file2a143b62373d.cpp.err.txt&#39; had status 1 <br></span></pre><br><br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><pre style=\"margin:0px;border:currentColor;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt!important;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:blue\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">sessionInfo</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">R version </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">3.2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">2015</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">12</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">10</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Platform</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> x86